##getproductbyasync
GET http://localhost:5223/api/products/1

### Get nonexistent product
GET http://localhost:5223/api/products/999

### Get all products
GET http://localhost:5223/api/products
Accept: application/json

### Create product
POST http://localhost:5223/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mechanical Keyboard",
  "description": "75% mechanical keyboard",
  "sku": "KB-002",
  "price": 299.90,
  "categoryId": 1
}

###
POST  http://localhost:5223/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "sku": "",
  "price": -10,
  "categoryId": 0
}

### Update product
PUT http://localhost:5223/api/products/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Wireless Mechanical Keyboard",
  "description": "75% wireless mechanical keyboard",
  "sku": "KB-002",
  "price": 349.90,
  "categoryId": 1
}
### Verify update
GET http://localhost:5223/api/products/2

### Delete product
DELETE http://localhost:5223/api/products/2

### verify delete
GET http://localhost:5223/api/Products/2